{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GG-Party</strong> is the ultimate open-world party game for up to 8 players! Grab your crew, pick your favorite color, and jump in - the rule is simple: the first to become a millionaire wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Never seen before:</strong> No more boring dice board games! Watching 7 other players roll the dice is a thing of the past. Welcome to the future of party games. GG-Party is a fresh party game packed with open-world vibes. You're not just watching - you're right in the middle of the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GG-Party Mode</strong><br>Explore a vibrant open world, take on wild quests, and invest your hard-earned cash wisely in real estate and shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgrade your basic houses with mining GPUs to generate continuous income - but be warned: sabotaged houses without power will suffer rent reductions, and GPUs don\u2019t mine without electricity. Makes sense, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 5 minutes, you\u2019ll get the chance to earn extra cash in exciting minigames. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play smart and strategic - the first player to hit millionaire status takes over the island and wins! And yes, making your friends' lives difficult is definitely part of the fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map / minimap are fully interactive: you can see where all players are, which buildings belong to whom, and which ones are sabotaged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796340/extras/4f00860e52f3c7fb09fa31cccc9d4d9a.poster.avif?t=1771166954\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796340/extras/4f00860e52f3c7fb09fa31cccc9d4d9a.webm?t=1771166954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796340/extras/4f00860e52f3c7fb09fa31cccc9d4d9a.mp4?t=1771166954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fresh Ideas &amp; Retro Vibes:</strong><br>Our minigames mix nostalgia with new concepts. Whether it's wild design, creative rules, or brilliant genre mashups - you\u2019ll find familiar classics with a whole new twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Current Minigames:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paintball:</strong> Pure FPS action with modes like Last Man Standing, Most Kills in Time, or First to 10 Kills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomber Dudes:</strong> Blow up your opponents (or yourself) - Last Man Standing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run:</strong> Run for your life! Who\u2019s the fastest in this parkour race?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helicopter:</strong> Intense air combat with multiple modes: Last Man Standing, Most Kills in Time, or First to 10 Kills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RC Monster Trucks:</strong> Off-road racing with mini trucks. Will you be the first to cross the finish line?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tanks:</strong> Arena action with heavy artillery in various game modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camper Wash:</strong> Funnier than it sounds - who can scrub their camper clean the fastest?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paintshop:</strong> Who removes the rust and repaints their car the fastest?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quads:</strong> Adrenaline-pumping four-wheel madness. Step on it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jet Ski:</strong> Pure water fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Hoverboards:</span></strong><span class=\"bb_strike\"> Speed through awesome tracks and leave everyone in the dust!</span>\u00a0\u00a0(temporarily removed)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Mini Golf:</span></strong><span class=\"bb_strike\"> Relaxed but no less competitive. Sink that shot and show your friends who's boss!</span> (temporarily removed)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And the best part?</strong><br>Over 30 more minigames are already in the works for 2026 and 2027 - but for now, our full focus is on the open-world experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We\u2019ve also got two more game modes in store:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigame Mode:</strong> Choose your favorite game and show your friends who\u2019s boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tournament Mode:</strong> Compete in a marathon of minigames - after each round, vote on the next game. Collect the most money cases and claim the win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re just getting started: <strong>GG-Party</strong> is constantly growing. New modes, new minigames, new features - the fun never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? Gather your friends, grab a controller, and show us what you\u2019ve got!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer Insider:</strong><br>Our artists are designing unique characters and levels - no asset flips, just pure originality. GG-Party will be a treat for the eyes and your funny bone. Let\u2019s go!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1796340?t=1771166954","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796340/3d3e5de8b32bb73c7e535791723f84020889fc4c/page_bg_