ament Mode:</strong> Compete in a marathon of minigames - after each round, vote on the next game. Collect the most money cases and claim the win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re just getting started: <strong>GG-Party</strong> is constantly growing. New modes, new minigames, new features - the fun never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? Gather your friends, grab a controller, and show us what you\u2019ve got!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer Insider:</strong><br>Our artists are designing unique characters and levels - no asset flips, just pure originality. GG-Party will be a treat for the eyes and your funny bone. Let\u2019s go!</p>","developers":["GoraGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796340/61398e0e8e4f123e1c054c3d22181fb373d1d692/header.jpg?t=1771166954","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Catalina<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5  or M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon Pro 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7  or M1 Pro<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD-Radeon-5000-Ser